      "key": "spec_renewal_conditions",
      "statement": "Universal Intake Triage owns classification and re-entry. Gap analysis applies intake diagnosis, locates supported cause, and retains unresolved alternatives. Justified changes re-enter the selected owning layer and reconcile affected downstream meaning without repricing sufficient upstream meaning. Unresolved cause or necessary change leaves dependent repair unjustified; observation may continue only under its existing grant. New Goals or Intent require the selected class to establish their work-wave, direction, or scope change, supported by concrete gap and owning decision; implementation pressure alone is insufficient. A requirement gap with stable direction and Product meaning can re-enter Requirements; an implementation defect under sufficient law can be repaired at its realized surface. Iteration cumulatively refines requirements/design, repeatedly re-derives realization against current constitutional surfaces, and feeds implementation, testing, replay, and scenario gaps into repricing while preserving authority direction.",
